          "message": {
            "text": "The table owns one collapsed-border edge graph because Blink merges every table-part source before painting any edge. The cached graph preserves source order, span interiors, logical writing direction, joint geometry, and pixel snapping; assigning winners back to cells cannot encode those decisions.",
            "markdown": "The table owns one collapsed-border edge graph because Blink merges every table-part source before painting any edge. The cached graph preserves source order, span interiors, logical writing direction, joint geometry, and pixel snapping; assigning winners back to cells cannot encode those decisions."
          },
