            "text": "DM-2327: computed background-size px terms are CSSOM values divided by effective zoom, while getBoundingClientRect geometry is physical. Multiply only px terms by cumulative effective zoom; leave percentages box-relative. Renderer cache lookup must not apply zoom again.",
